{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20759","headline":"萧宅二三子赠答诗二十首 客请虾? · 卢仝","name":"萧宅二三子赠答诗二十首 客请虾?","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虾𢋙𢋙，叩头莫语人闻声，扬州虾蚬忽得\n腥臊臭秽逐我行，我身化作青泥坑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20759.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20759","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}